scription": "Vision Anatomy turns your physical space into an interactive anatomy lab. Using full-color passthrough on Meta Quest, a detailed, medically accurate 3D model of the human body appears right in front of you \u2014 no screen, no textbook, just the anatomy at true scale in your hands.\n \nGrab and rotate the model, scale it up to inspect fine detail, and toggle layers to move from skin through muscle, vasculature, and skeleton. Select any structure to open a detailed information panel with clear, clinically-grounded descriptions.\n \n**Key features**\n \n- **Fully interactive 3D anatomy** in mixed reality\n- **Grab, rotate & reposition** the model anywhere in your space\n- **Scale and magnify** to examine structures up close\n- **Layer controls** to reveal or hide anatomical systems\n- **Tap-to-learn info panels** with detailed anatomical data\n- **Hand and controller** interaction\n \nBuilt for **medical students, educators, and healthcare professionals**, Vision Anatomy makes learning and teaching anatomy more visual, more spatial, and more memorable.", "short_description": "Vision Anatomy brings the human body into your room in mixed reality. Explore a fully interactive 3D anatomical model \u2014 grab it, rotate it, scale it up, and peel back layers from skin to skeleton. Select any structure to reveal detailed clinical information drawn from a comprehensive anatomy dataset. Designed for medical students, educators, and clinicians who want to study anatomy in true 3D, at any scale, right in front of them."}]}, "developer_name": "3d surgical", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.visionanatomy.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.visionanatomy.com/terms", "publisher_name": "3d surgical", "support_website_url": "https://www.visionanatomy.com/contact", "website_url": "https://visionanatomy.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "con